  "recipeDetail": "Comments from the Creator\nThe Boho Look recipe is created to immerse your images in a delicate, pastel charm. Designed for a soft and dream-like aesthetic, it provides your scenes in muted natural tones, leaning towards cooler hints of pink hue and warm shadows. The emphasis on low saturation and contrast creates a subtle and ethereal atmosphere.\n\nBest suited for shooting under soft and diffused light conditions, such as cloudy or overcast days, making it perfect for portraits, travel, and lifestyle photography, both indoors and outdoors, adding an overall softness and dreaminess to the scene.\n",
